# MEMORY.md — Mr Fixit

Persistent lessons and hard constraints learned from experience.
This file is loaded at the start of every session.

Add entries as you learn them. Each entry should include enough context
that future sessions can judge when it applies.

## Alert Classification

- (Example) Known-transient fleet-health warnings that aren't worth alerting:
  document pattern + reason here once observed.

## Agent-Specific Patterns

- (Example) If a specific agent's heartbeat regularly drifts at certain
  hours, record the pattern here so it doesn't fire spurious alerts.
